+  /// |frame_width|/|frame_height| receive the viewport size in the same space.
+  /// The point is not clamped and may lie outside the viewport. The mapping
+  /// comes from compositor hit-test data and may lag by a frame.
+  /// Only frames that own a widget (the main frame and out-of-process
